<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Güvenlik & Reconnaissance Raporu — {{ report.target }}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0a0e17;
      --bg-card: rgba(18, 26, 43, 0.75);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(26, 38, 64, 0.85);
      --border-color: rgba(64, 93, 140, 0.3);
      --text-main: #e2e8f0;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --cyan-accent: #00f2fe;
      --blue-accent: #4facfe;
      --crit-color: #ff3366;
      --high-color: #ff9900;
      --med-color: #facc15;
      --low-color: #38bdf8;
      --success-color: #10b981;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 100% 100%, rgba(79, 172, 254, 0.06) 0px, transparent 50%);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1300px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .header-title h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-accent), var(--blue-accent));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .header-title p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .header-meta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(10, 14, 23, 0.6);
      padding: 0.8rem 1.4rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .meta-item span {
      color: var(--cyan-accent);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* Metric Grid */
    .metric-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .metric-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .metric-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--cyan-accent);
    }

    .metric-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 4px;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--cyan-accent);
    }

    .metric-card.critical::before { background: var(--crit-color); }
    .metric-card.high::before { background: var(--high-color); }
    .metric-card.ports::before { background: var(--blue-accent); }
    .metric-card.dirs::before { background: var(--success-color); }

    .metric-title {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .metric-value {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    }

    /* Section Card */
    .section-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .section-badge {
      background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
      color: var(--cyan-accent);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    }

    /* Table Styles */
    .table-container {
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    th {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      background: rgba(10, 14, 23, 0.6);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    td {
      padding: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    tr:hover td {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    }

    /* Badges */
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .badge-crit { background: rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.2); color: var(--crit-color); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.4); }
    .badge-high { background: rgba(255, 153, 0, 0.2); color: var(--high-color); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 153, 0, 0.4); }
    .badge-med { background: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.2); color: var(--med-color); border: 1px solid rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.4); }
    .badge-low { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: var(--low-color); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4); }
    .badge-open { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: var(--success-color); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); }
    .badge-http { background: rgba(79, 172, 254, 0.2); color: var(--blue-accent); }

    .code-tag {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--cyan-accent);
    }

    .vuln-desc {
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      max-width: 500px;
    }

    .ref-link {
      color: var(--blue-accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .ref-link:hover {
      color: var(--cyan-accent);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* Filter Controls */
    .filter-input {
      background: rgba(10, 14, 23, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      outline: none;
      width: 250px;
    }

    .filter-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--cyan-accent);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 3rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
      <div class="header-title">
        <h1>Ağ Recon & Güvenlik Raporu</h1>
        <p>Otomatik Zafiyet & Keşif Analizi Sonuçları</p>
      </div>
      <div class="header-meta">
        <div class="meta-item">Hedef: <span>{{ report.target }}</span></div>
        <div class="meta-item">Tarih: <span>{{ report.scan_date[:19] }}</span></div>
        <div class="meta-item">Süre: <span>{{ report.duration_seconds }}s</span></div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Executive Metric Cards -->
    <div class="metric-grid">
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-title">Keşfedilen Hostlar</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ report.total_hosts }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card ports">
        <div class="metric-title">Açık Portlar</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ report.total_open_ports }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card critical">
        <div class="metric-title">Kritik / Yüksek Zafiyetler</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ report.severity_breakdown.CRITICAL + report.severity_breakdown.HIGH }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card dirs">
        <div class="metric-title">Web Bulguları / Yollar</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ report.total_findings }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hosts & Services Section -->
    <div class="section-card">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span>🌐</span> Keşfedilen Hostlar & Açık Servisler
        </div>
        <span class="section-badge">{{ report.hosts | length }} Host</span>
      </div>
      <div class="table-container">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>IP & Hostname</th>
              <th>MAC & Yöntem</th>
              <th>Açık Port</th>
              <th>Servis Adı</th>
              <th>Versiyon & Başlık</th>
              <th>Banner / Detay</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for h in report.hosts %}
              {% if h.services %}
                {% for s in h.services %}
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <strong>{{ h.host.ip }}</strong>
                    {% if h.host.hostname %}<br><small style="color:var(--text-muted)">{{ h.host.hostname }}</small>{% endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td>
                    <span class="code-tag">{{ h.host.discovery_method }}</span>
                    {% if h.host.mac %}<br><small style="color:var(--text-muted)">{{ h.host.mac }}</small>{% endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td><span class="badge badge-open">{{ s.port }}/{{ s.protocol }}</span></td>
                  <td><strong>{{ s.service_name }}</strong></td>
                  <td>
                    {% if s.service_version %}
                      <span class="code-tag">{{ s.service_version }}</span>
                    {% elif s.http_title %}
                      <span style="color:var(--cyan-accent)">{{ s.http_title }}</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span style="color:var(--text-muted)">-</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td>
                    {% if s.banner_raw %}
                      <small style="color:var(--text-muted)">{{ s.banner_raw[:60] }}</small>
                    {% else %}
                      <small style="color:var(--text-muted)">Aktif servis</small>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              {% else %}
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>{{ h.host.ip }}</strong></td>
                  <td><span class="code-tag">{{ h.host.discovery_method }}</span></td>
                  <td colspan="4" style="color:var(--text-muted)">Açık port tespit edilmedi.</td>
                </tr>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Vulnerabilities Section -->
    <div class="section-card">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span>🛡️</span> Tespit Edilen Zafiyetler & CVE'ler
        </div>
        <span class="section-badge">{{ report.total_vulns }} Zafiyet</span>
      </div>
      <div class="table-container">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>CVE ID</th>
              <th>Şiddet (CVSS)</th>
              <th>Etkilenen Servis</th>
              <th>Açıklama & Risk</th>
              <th>Öneri & Referans</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% set all_vulns = [] %}
            {% for h in report.hosts %}
              {% for v in h.vulnerabilities %}
                {% set _ = all_vulns.append(v) %}
                <tr>
                  <td><strong style="color: #fff; font-family:'JetBrains Mono'">{{ v.cve_id }}</strong></td>
                  <td>
                    {% if v.severity == 'CRITICAL' %}
                      <span class="badge badge-crit">CRITICAL ({{ v.cvss_score }})</span>
                    {% elif v.severity == 'HIGH' %}
                      <span class="badge badge-high">HIGH ({{ v.cvss_score }})</span>
                    {% elif v.severity == 'MEDIUM' %}
                      <span class="badge badge-med">MEDIUM ({{ v.cvss_score }})</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span class="badge badge-low">{{ v.severity }} ({{ v.cvss_score }})</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td><span class="code-tag">{{ v.affected_service }}</span></td>
                  <td class="vuln-desc">{{ v.description }}</td>
                  <td>
                    {% if v.mitigation %}
                      <div style="margin-bottom:0.3rem; font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--success-color)"><strong>Öneri:</strong> {{ v.mitigation }}</div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% for ref in v.references %}
                      <a href="{{ ref }}" target="_blank" class="ref-link">🔗 Referans</a><br>
                    {% endfor %}
                  </td>
                </tr>
              {% endfor %}
            {% endfor %}
            {% if all_vulns | length == 0 %}
              <tr>
                <td colspan="5" style="text-align:center; color:var(--success-color); padding: 2rem;">
                  ✅ Taranan servislerde bilinen kritik CVE zafiyeti bulunamadı.
                </td>
              </tr>
            {% endif %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Web Directory Findings Section -->
    <div class="section-card">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span>📁</span> Web Dizin & Dosya Bulguları (Fuzzer)
        </div>
        <span class="section-badge">{{ report.total_findings }} Bulgu</span>
      </div>
      <div class="table-container">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Durum Kodu</th>
              <th>Hedef URL & Yol</th>
              <th>Boyut</th>
              <th>Sayfa Başlığı / Yönlendirme</th>
              <th>Kritiklik</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% set all_dirs = [] %}
            {% for h in report.hosts %}
              {% for f in h.dir_findings %}
                {% set _ = all_dirs.append(f) %}
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    {% if f.status_code == 200 %}
                      <span class="badge badge-open">200 OK</span>
                    {% elif f.status_code in [301, 302, 307] %}
                      <span class="badge badge-high">{{ f.status_code }} REDIRECT</span>
                    {% elif f.status_code in [401, 403] %}
                      <span class="badge badge-med">{{ f.status_code }} AUTH</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span class="badge badge-low">{{ f.status_code }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td><a href="{{ f.url }}" target="_blank" class="ref-link">{{ f.url }}</a></td>
                  <td><span class="code-tag">{{ f.content_length }} B</span></td>
                  <td>
                    {% if f.title %}
                      <span style="color:var(--text-main)">{{ f.title }}</span>
                    {% elif f.redirect_location %}
                      <span style="color:var(--text-muted)">➜ {{ f.redirect_location }}</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span style="color:var(--text-muted)">-</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td>
                    {% if f.is_sensitive %}
                      <span class="badge badge-crit">⚠️ HASSAS DOSYA</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.8rem">Standart</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                </tr>
              {% endfor %}
            {% endfor %}
            {% if all_dirs | length == 0 %}
              <tr>
                <td colspan="5" style="text-align:center; color:var(--text-muted); padding: 2rem;">
                  Web dizin taraması yapılmadı veya ek bulgu tespit edilmedi.
                </td>
              </tr>
            {% endif %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <p>Bu rapor <strong>Ağ Recon & Tarama Aracı</strong> tarafından otomatik olarak üretilmiştir.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:0.3rem; font-size:0.75rem; color:#64748b">Yalnızca yetkilendirilmiş lab ve güvenlik değerlendirme ortamlarında geçerlidir.</p>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
